53	     6	// A SLOT is a region of the UI that features fill. Whatever renders a region does not list what
54	     7	// goes in it; a contribution to a region (a panel, a table column, a row action, a toolbar
55	     8	// control, a nav link) is a separate file, registered by discovery (slots/discover.ts).
